      "tree": {
        "sha": "6b8ba757d3e7b2959003ba6e05777c37b155b342",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/6b8ba757d3e7b2959003ba6e05777c37b155b342"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 6b8ba757d3e7b2959003ba6e05777c37b155b342\nparent fb9c53c515cabbb89ff2429a2c7cd3f9f7da2823\nauthor furszy <matiasfurszyfer@protonmail.com> 1784821354 -0400\ncommitter furszy <matiasfurszyfer@protonmail.com> 1784834604 -0400\n\nwallet: drop redundant notification in CommitTransaction\n\nWhen the wallet creates a spend, CommitTransaction notifies the new tx\nand every wallet tx it spends from. But no other spending path does\nthis: SyncTransaction, for a spend arriving from the mempool or a block,\nnotifies only the tx it was given, and RecursiveUpdateTxState, for\nabandoning one, notifies only the txs whose own state changed. The ones\nwhose outputs become spendable again did not change state, so they are\nnot notified either.\n\nOn top of that, the GUI is the only consumer, and neither of its two\nsubscribers needs it. The transaction table takes the CT_UPDATED and\nmarks the notified tx row for a status refresh, but that status comes\nfrom the tx's own depth, maturity and abandoned flag, and from whether\nit is trusted. A spend changes none of that, and the amounts are not\npart of the refresh (which are actually not changed during a spend).\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEA++0fqwRHQpmlZfQXdI8zGhqpiMFAmpiaiwACgkQXdI8zGhq\npiMroRAAqBnuhAwu+DfTy6f+UAk7UFg355tJMhTMsLPte83MAPH+8dVbipAZTtar\ncx4XR4zSnpLXH+kIOlZUCz5gul30cqg1w1Rs55/cwc+vYZCfKbYrVpbBNhWqSU/m\nKIUyKyDAWkQtVfYi3wqGTxq0iFNWMsCJbuCLnOxs+5ax+nWwD+EbZtuvngraNvN2\nLiv3DiChtq9ArKZKf235pU5j+gp3dn1+cMqlx6NBW8ryBCdTnVQK7tCpJRE+1wXh\n09XdOf3Px7KN45csoT1APABEkaEa26G4h9v23u4iRGNnmCzwqQqwS3bTGGPsm2Kv\nu2ccV7LccIYxYRog4kqkisFA0EjA2vJLWywPKJ4CAiQjyLwhVldC4ZoGYb1Si3aH\nTb3BIUz1MGE0y2ri7mvb1Hkw6Jb5X7shcdYVQChl9q+5fatTO6Pk/k4XipSIfQ0A\nzmFTgMTIB0suTr2wqM0hQ6nseKN2ePXubaocyF67TIIIHoR4BfTAlyuCl+0OmboT\ng5Sc1lMA5FxMXqep2+gO1HQUThp/yuRMTd6wTsAYplFR90fjGM8IKndemR2rXmIV\nLEU037Tsn9al+4TkWJrH9tz1NSmr9vOivHsbdhETYrqUbjR9xdFghQqBwCmDY5lD\n4gWkgdeX3kqlAeB/fADnhG+2REtEDQTXFldPxPD0ySDNfMq1Y20=\n=ifBz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
